    \ (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File created successfully: inquire/circle_packing/initial_guesses.py\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 473 | 1 | KKT-Magnitude Guided Nudging: Breaking High-Leverage Contacts (V49) | Inquire I | 291 | 2.5411713 |\n| 467 | 1 | Utility Run: KKT Multiplier Export for Inquire_207_SOTA (V48) - Tag Fix | Inquire I | 287 | 2.5411713 |\n| 462 | 1 | Shadow-Price Guided Nudging & KKT Multiplier Analysis (V46) - Nested Multiplier Fix | Inquire I | 281 | 2.5411713 |\n| 460 | 1 | Shadow-Price Guided Nudging\
