    \ 1 | Trust-Constr Tuning: Tighter ftol (1e-10) with SLSQP SOTA Initial Guess for KKT Extraction (Inqui... | Inquire II | 596 | 2.5969432 |\n| 946 | 1 | Trust-Constr with SLSQP SOTA Initial Guess for KKT Extraction (Inquire II) | Inquire II | 594 | 2.5969432 |\n| 942 | 1 | Trust-Constr Tuning: Tighter gtol (1e-10) for Higher Score and KKT Extraction (Inquire II) | Inquire II | 592 | 2.5520180 |\n| 937 | 1 | Verification of KKT Extraction with Refined Active Constraint Heuristic (Inquire II) | Inquire II | 590 | 2.5520180 |\n| 931 | 1 | Final Verification of Trust-Constr Baseline with KKT Extraction (Inquire II) | Inquire II | 587 | 2.5520180 |\n| 930 | 1 | Debug Trust-Constr Method String for KKT Extraction (Inquire II) | Inquire II | 585 | 2.5520180 |\n| 928 | 1 | Verified Trust-Constr Baseline (No Debugger Required) for KKT Extraction (Inquire II) | Inquire II | 584 | 2.5520180 |\n| 925 | 1 | Verified Trust-Constr Baseline for KKT Extraction (Inquire II) | Inquire II | 582 | 2.5520180\
    \ |\n\nPage 1 of 9 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-9, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
