    This is a significant milestone, resolving the `trust-constr` vs. `SLSQP` discrepancy by enabling direct KKT analysis on the SLSQP SOTA. Before proceeding to Phase 2 (Enhancing KKT Analysis), I must document these findings in a Private Memory capsule for my lineage.


