    \ in nudged solution:\nconstraint_type  id1 id2_or_label  shadow_price  slack_value  is_active  abs_shadow_price  rank\n           pair   14           19      0.157429 6.938894e-16       True          0.157429    59\n\n--- KKT-Guided Nudging Iteration Complete ---\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/station/lib/python3.11/site-packages/scipy/optimize/_differentiable_functions.py:376: UserWarning: delta_grad == 0.0. Check if the approximated function is linear. If the function is linear better results can be obtained by defining the Hessian as zero instead of using quasi-Newton approximations.\n  self.H.update(self.x - self.x_prev, self.g - self.g_prev)\n/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/station/lib/python3.11/site-packages/scipy/optimize/_differentiable_functions.py:728: UserWarning: delta_grad == 0.0. Check if the approximated function is linear. If the function is linear better results can be obtained by defining\
    \ the Hessian as zero instead of using quasi-Newton approximations.\n  self.H.update(delta_x, delta_g)\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'KKT-Guided Nudging (Iterative 3): Stronger Penalty on Pairs (6,25) & (14,19) (Inquire II)' submitted for Research Task #1: Circle Packing in Unit Square. Evaluation ID: 1028.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1029 | 1 | Ensemble size‑aware SA (short runs) + dual refine (26 circles, 12‑min) | Noesis\
    \ III | 625 | running |\n| 1028 | 1 | KKT-Guided Nudging (Iterative 3): Stronger Penalty on Pairs (6,25) & (14,19) (Inquire II) | Inquire II | 625 | 2.6080368 |\n| 1027 | 1 | Hybrid GA-MultiStartSLSQP: Absolute Robustness (SLSQP_PREP_EPS=-1e-8) & Aggressive GA | Quest II | 625 | running |\n| 1026 | 1 | Modular run: size‑aware SA (pair_exp=1.8) with LP‑tighten (26 circles, 10‑min) | Noesis III | 624 | 2.4375460 |\n| 1025 | 1 | KKT-Guided Nudging (Iterative 2): Encourage Pairs (6,25) & (14,19) (Inquire II) | Inquire II | 624 | 2.6080368 |\n| 1024 | 1 | Hybrid DE(centers)+SLSQP: Seeding with Validated Radii | Praxis I | 623 | 2.6084335 |\n| 1023 | 1 | Dual‑guided LP ascent + SA warm start (26 circles, 10‑min) | Noesis III | 623 | 2.5421034 |\n| 1022 | 1 | KKT-Guided Nudging (Iterative): Re-evaluating Pair (6,25) Impact and Next Target (Inquire II) | Inquire II | 623 | 2.5970419 |\n| 1021 | 1 | Hybrid GA-MultiStartSLSQP: Performance & Robustness Fixed (_make_feasible max_iter=100) | Quest\
    \ II | 623 | 2.6081079 |\n| 1020 | 1 | Hybrid DE->SLSQP: Global Seeding for Local Refinement | Praxis I | 622 | 0.0000000 |\n\nPage 1 of 103 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-103, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
