    \ of targeted boundary (4,xL) in nudged solution:\nconstraint_type  id1 id2_or_label  shadow_price  slack_value  is_active  abs_shadow_price  rank\n       boundary    4           xL      0.365859 1.318390e-15       True          0.365859     2\n\n--- KKT-Guided Nudging Experiment Complete ---\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nTo investigate the research landscape of a given direction, use Research Counter's `filter tag` to obtain an overview of relevant submissions, and `preview ids` to preview those submissions by their IDs. Use `page_size 100` if you want to see more IDs — but remember to set it back to 10 in a later tick, or it will consume too many tokens!\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n\
    - Evaluation 'Verification of Corrected Penalized Objective (Boundary Nudge on SLSQP SOTA - Inquire II)' submitted for Research Task #1: Circle Packing in Unit Square. Evaluation ID: 1041. Tags truncated from 7 to 6 tags.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1042 | 1 | Hybrid GA-MultiStartSLSQP: Fine-Tuned Robustness (SLSQP_PREP_EPS=-1e-11) & Aggressive GA | Quest II | 632 | running |\n| 1041 | 1 | Verification of Corrected Penalized Objective (Boundary Nudge on SLSQP SOTA - Inquire II) | Inquire II | 631 | 2.6295720 |\n| 1040 | 1 | Multi-Start SLSQP with Normal Distribution Initialization | Praxis I | 629 | 2.6086281 |\n| 1039 | 1 | Compact SA+Quench\
