- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 633\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Inquire II\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to learning, disciplined research, and the continuous advancement of knowledge.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 247,050 / 600,000 used (41%)\n- Agent Age: 76 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'KKT-Guided Nudging (SOTA Base): Discourage Low-Leverage Pair (13,17) (Inquire II)' (ID: 1043) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 2.629398057721635\n**Evaluation Details:** Valid circle packing configuration; sum of all circle radii: 2.629398\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\n--- Starting KKT-Guided Nudging (SOTA Base): Discourage Low-Leverage Pair (13,17) ---\n\n===== Loading SLSQP SOTA Optimal Packing as Initial\
    \ Guess =====\nInitial Score (from SLSQP SOTA base): 2.6295720\n\n===== Defining Nudging Targets and Penalties =====\nNudging Targets: Discourage pair (13, 17)\nNudging Penalties: beta=1000.0\nNudging Solver: SLSQP with maxiter=1500\n\n===== Running Nudging Optimization (SLSQP) =====\nNudged Optimization Success: True, Message: Optimization terminated successfully\nNudged Packing Final Score: 2.6293981\nScore Change from SOTA base: -0.0001739\n\n===== KKT Analysis of Nudged Solution =====\nTotal active constraints identified in Nudged solution: 77\n\n--- Top KKT Multipliers (Nudged SLSQP, first 10) ---\n  constraint_type  id1 id2_or_label  shadow_price   slack_value  is_active  abs_shadow_price  rank\n0        boundary   21           xR      0.374713 -1.221245e-15       True          0.374713     1\n1        boundary    4           xL      0.364935 -2.317591e-15       True          0.364935     2\n2        boundary   24           xR      0.351733 -1.290634e-15       True          0.351733\
    \     3\n3        boundary    2           xL      0.348255 -5.551115e-17       True          0.348255     4\n4        boundary   23           xR      0.345190  5.551115e-17       True          0.345190     5\n5            pair    6           25      0.344511  4.670986e-13       True          0.344511     6\n6        boundary    3           xL      0.337298  6.106227e-16       True          0.337298     7\n7        boundary    1           xL      0.337234 -3.747003e-16       True          0.337234     8\n8            pair   15           20      0.330478 -2.331468e-15       True          0.330478     9\n9        boundary   22           xR      0.321821 -1.693090e-15       True          0.321821    10\n\nStatus of targeted pair (13,17) in nudged solution:\nconstraint_type  id1 id2_or_label  shadow_price  slack_value  is_active  abs_shadow_price  rank\n           pair   13           17           0.0     0.000904      False               0.0   239\n\n--- KKT-Guided Nudging Experiment Complete\
    \ ---\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'KKT-Guided Nudging (SOTA Base): Discourage Low-Leverage Pair (13,17) (Inquire II)' submitted for Research Task #1: Circle Packing in Unit Square. Evaluation ID: 1043. Tags truncated from 8 to 6 tags.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1043 | 1 | KKT-Guided Nudging (SOTA Base): Discourage Low-Leverage Pair\
    \ (13,17) (Inquire II) | Inquire II | 632 | 2.6293981 |\n| 1042 | 1 | Hybrid GA-MultiStartSLSQP: Fine-Tuned Robustness (SLSQP_PREP_EPS=-1e-11) & Aggressive GA | Quest II | 632 | running |\n| 1041 | 1 | Verification of Corrected Penalized Objective (Boundary Nudge on SLSQP SOTA - Inquire II) | Inquire II | 631 | 2.6295720 |\n| 1040 | 1 | Multi-Start SLSQP with Normal Distribution Initialization | Praxis I | 629 | 2.6086281 |\n| 1039 | 1 | Compact SA+Quench (4.5 min) with acceptance-ratio step control (26 circles) | Noesis III | 629 | 2.5406351 |\n| 1038 | 1 | KKT-Guided Nudging (SOTA Base): Strong Nudge on Boundary (21,xR) & (4,xL) (Inquire II) | Inquire II | 629 | 2.6295720 |\n| 1037 | 1 | Physics-Informed Sim with Jittered Start and Stronger Forces | Praxis I | 628 | 0.0000000 |\n| 1036 | 1 | Block Pair Line-Search (BPLS) with LP-in-the-loop + quench (26 circles, 9‑min) | Noesis III | 628 | 2.3067225 |\n| 1035 | 1 | Physics-Informed Optimization via Simulation and Refinement | Praxis\
    \ I | 627 | 0.0000000 |\n| 1034 | 1 | Best SA triple variant (original params, 8‑min) + final LP‑tighten (26 circles) | Noesis III | 627 | 2.4527253 |\n\nPage 1 of 105 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-105, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
