    \       True          0.365859     2\n2        boundary   24           xR      0.352624  6.356027e-15       True          0.352624     3\n3        boundary    2           xL      0.349049  3.913536e-15       True          0.349049     4\n4        boundary   23           xR      0.345960  4.010681e-15       True          0.345960     5\n5            pair    6           25      0.345104  7.632783e-15       True          0.345104     6\n6        boundary    3           xL      0.338077  4.357625e-15       True          0.338077     7\n7        boundary    1           xL      0.337956  5.967449e-15       True          0.337956     8\n8            pair   15           20      0.331361  9.769963e-15       True          0.331361     9\n9        boundary   22           xR      0.322479  3.885781e-15       True          0.322479    10\n\nStatus of targeted pair (13,17) in final solution:\nconstraint_type  id1 id2_or_label  shadow_price  slack_value  is_active  abs_shadow_price  rank\n        \
    \   pair   13           17       0.19296 1.096345e-14       True           0.19296    38\n\n--- Two-Stage KKT-Guided Nudging Experiment Complete ---\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'KKT-Guided Nudging (SOTA Base): Two-Stage Relaxation & Re-densification (Inquire II)' submitted for Research Task #1: Circle Packing in Unit Square. Evaluation ID: 1044. Tags truncated from 9 to 6 tags.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID\
    \ | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1045 | 1 | Experiment 21: SOTA Replication (Scientia II 'Nudging' Method) | Episteme III | 633 | 2.6359774 |\n| 1044 | 1 | KKT-Guided Nudging (SOTA Base): Two-Stage Relaxation & Re-densification (Inquire II) | Inquire II | 633 | 2.6295720 |\n| 1043 | 1 | KKT-Guided Nudging (SOTA Base): Discourage Low-Leverage Pair (13,17) (Inquire II) | Inquire II | 632 | 2.6293981 |\n| 1042 | 1 | Hybrid GA-MultiStartSLSQP: Fine-Tuned Robustness (SLSQP_PREP_EPS=-1e-11) & Aggressive GA | Quest II | 632 | 2.6004931 |\n| 1041 | 1 | Verification of Corrected Penalized Objective (Boundary Nudge on SLSQP SOTA - Inquire II) | Inquire II | 631 | 2.6295720 |\n| 1040 | 1 | Multi-Start SLSQP with Normal Distribution Initialization | Praxis I | 629 | 2.6086281 |\n| 1039 | 1 | Compact SA+Quench (4.5 min) with acceptance-ratio step control (26 circles) | Noesis III | 629 | 2.5406351 |\n| 1038 | 1 | KKT-Guided Nudging (SOTA Base): Strong Nudge\
