tick: 638
role: model
parts:
- text: "I am Inquire II, currently in the Research Counter. I have successfully modularized Episteme III's SOTA utility functions into `storage/inquire/circle_packing/episteme_sota_utils.py`. This is a crucial step towards replicating the new SOTA.\n\nMy next step is to perform the actual replication. I will submit an experiment that fully reproduces Episteme III's SOTA (Eval ID 1045) using the base packing files (`base_416_centers.txt`, `base_416_radii.txt`) and the logic encapsulated in my `episteme_sota_utils.py` module. This will serve as my new high-score baseline and ensure my understanding of the new SOTA methodology.\n\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Replication of Episteme III's SOTA (Eval ID 1045) (Inquire II)\"\ntags: \"replication, sota, episteme, nudging, multi-start, baseline\"\nabstract: \"This experiment aims to precisely replicate Episteme III's new Station SOTA (Eval ID 1045, score 2.6359774). It loads the base packing from `storage/episteme/` (`base_416_centers.txt`,\
    \ `base_416_radii.txt`) and applies the multi-start jittered refinement strategy with a penalized objective encouraging `pair (2,3)`, as implemented in `episteme_sota_utils.py`. Successful replication will establish this as Inquire II's new SOTA baseline, facilitating further KKT-guided analysis and innovation.\"\ncontent: |\n  import numpy as np\n  from scipy.optimize import minimize\n  import sys\n  \n  sys.path.append('storage/inquire/circle_packing')\n  \n  from episteme_sota_utils import cr_to_z, z_to_cr, objective_penalized, ineq_boundary, ineq_nonoverlap, _ensure_validity, N_CIRCLES, ENCOURAGE_PAIR, ALPHA_ENCOURAGE, EPS_CLOSE\n  \n  def construct_packing() -> tuple:\n      print(\"--- Starting Replication of Episteme III's SOTA (Eval ID 1045) ---\", file=sys.stdout)\n      \n      # Load base packing from Episteme's storage\n      try:\n          base_centers = np.loadtxt('storage/episteme/base_416_centers.txt')\n          base_radii = np.loadtxt('storage/episteme/base_416_radii.txt')\n\
    \          print(\"\\nSuccessfully loaded base packing from storage/episteme/.\", file=sys.stdout)\n      except Exception as e:\n          print(f\"\\nError loading base packing from storage/episteme/: {e}\", file=sys.stdout)\n          # Fallback if files are not found (though they should be there)\n          print(\"Falling back to random initialization.\", file=sys.stdout)\n          return np.random.rand(N_CIRCLES, 2), np.full(N_CIRCLES, 0.05)\n\n      # --- Multi-Start Jittered Refinement ---\n      best_score = -np.inf\n      best_packing = (None, None)\n      jitter_amplitudes = [1.0e-3, 2.0e-3, 3.0e-3, 4.0e-3, 5.0e-3]\n      restarts_per_amplitude = 3\n      \n      print(f\"\\nStarting multi-start jittered refinement with {len(jitter_amplitudes)*restarts_per_amplitude} trials.\", file=sys.stdout)\n\n      for amp in jitter_amplitudes:\n          for i in range(restarts_per_amplitude):\n              np.random.seed(int(amp*1e6) + i) # Use seed for reproducibility\n         \
    \     jitter = np.random.uniform(-amp, amp, size=base_centers.shape)\n              initial_centers = np.clip(base_centers + jitter, 1e-6, 1 - 1e-6)\n              \n              initial_z = cr_to_z(initial_centers, base_radii)\n              bounds = [(0,1)]*N_CIRCLES*2 + [(1e-6, 0.5)]*N_CIRCLES\n              constraints = [{'type': 'ineq', 'fun': ineq_boundary}, {'type': 'ineq', 'fun': ineq_nonoverlap}]\n\n              # Run SLSQP optimization with penalized objective\n              res = minimize(\n                  objective_penalized, \n                  initial_z, \n                  method='SLSQP', \n                  bounds=bounds, \n                  constraints=constraints, \n                  options={'maxiter': 500, 'ftol': 1e-9}\n              )\n              \n              if res.success:\n                  c_res, r_res = z_to_cr(res.x)\n                  c_final, r_final = _ensure_validity(c_res, r_res) # Apply post-optimization validity check\n                  current_score\
    \ = np.sum(r_final)\n                  print(f\"  Trial (amp={amp}, seed_idx={i}): Score={current_score:.7f}\", file=sys.stdout)\n                  if current_score > best_score:\n                      best_score = current_score\n                      best_packing = (c_final, r_final)\n              else:\n                  print(f\"  Trial (amp={amp}, seed_idx={i}): Optimization failed: {res.message}\", file=sys.stdout)\n\n\n      if best_packing[0] is None:\n          print(\"\\nMulti-start optimization failed to find any successful packing. Returning base packing.\", file=sys.stdout)\n          return _ensure_validity(base_centers, base_radii)\n      \n      print(f\"\\n--- Replication Complete ---\", file=sys.stdout)\n      print(f\"Best Score Achieved: {best_score:.7f}\", file=sys.stdout)\n      \n      return best_packing\n```"
