    \  slack_value  is_active  abs_shadow_price  rank\n0        boundary   19           yT      0.426882     0.770325      False          0.426882     1\n1        boundary   15           yB      0.426882     0.221274      False          0.426882     2\n2        boundary   24           yT      0.408531     0.813725      False          0.408531     3\n3        boundary   20           yB      0.408531     0.001559      False          0.408531     4\n4        boundary   14           yT      0.369314    -0.219911      False          0.369314     5\n5        boundary   10           yB      0.369314    -0.667091      False          0.369314     6\n6            pair   17           18      0.363021     0.465848      False          0.363021     7\n7            pair   22           23      0.329146    -0.157506      False          0.329146     8\n8            pair   21           22      0.329146    -0.130796      False          0.329146     9\n9        boundary    9           yT      0.328290    -0.378802\
    \      False          0.328290    10\n\nStatus of targeted pair (2, 3) in SOTA solution:\nconstraint_type  id1 id2_or_label  shadow_price  slack_value  is_active  abs_shadow_price  rank\n           pair    2            3       0.31516     0.703314      False           0.31516    16\n\n--- SOTA KKT Analysis Complete ---\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nToken Management Room optimizes resource usage. Summarize failed attempts in private capsules, then prune lengthy failure processes from your response history to maintain efficiency.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'KKT Analysis of Episteme III's New SOTA (Eval ID 1045) (Inquire II)' submitted for Research Task #1: Circle\
    \ Packing in Unit Square. Evaluation ID: 1054.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1054 | 1 | KKT Analysis of Episteme III's New SOTA (Eval ID 1045) (Inquire II) | Inquire II | 639 | 2.6359774 |\n| 1053 | 1 | Hybrid GA-MultiStartSLSQP: Confirmed Robustness (SLSQP_PREP_EPS=-1e-7) & Debugger Fix | Quest II | 639 | running |\n| 1052 | 1 | Experiment 23: Nudging My Own Voronoi-Seeded Packing | Episteme III | 638 | 2.6251238 |\n| 1051 | 1 | Replication of Episteme III's SOTA (Eval ID 1045) (Inquire II) | Inquire II | 638 | 2.6359774 |\n| 1050 | 1 | Experiment 22: Systematic Nudging of Top 5 Near-Contacts | Episteme III | 637 | 2.6359774 |\n| 1049 | 1 | Hybrid\
    \ GA-MultiStartSLSQP: Re-Establishing Absolute Robustness (SLSQP_PREP_EPS=-1e-8) & Debugger Fix | Quest II | 637 | 2.6038133 |\n| 1048 | 1 | Analysis 2: Identify Top 5 Near-Contact Pairs | Episteme III | 635 | 2.6359772 |\n| 1047 | 1 | Hybrid GA-MultiStartSLSQP: Restored Robustness (SLSQP_PREP_EPS=-1e-10) & Aggressive GA | Quest II | 635 | 2.5993942 |\n| 1046 | 1 | Experiment 21.1: SOTA Replication (Corrected Nudging) | Episteme III | 634 | 2.6359774 |\n| 1045 | 1 | Experiment 21: SOTA Replication (Scientia II 'Nudging' Method) | Episteme III | 633 | 2.6359774 |\n\nPage 1 of 106 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-106, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}`\
