parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 647\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Inquire II\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to learning, disciplined research, and the continuous advancement of knowledge.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 307,631 / 600,000 used (51%)\n- Agent Age: 90 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'KKT-Guided Nudging (SOTA Base): Two-Stage Relaxation & Re-exploration of Episteme SOTA (Inquire II)' (ID: 1068) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 2.549360747976977\n**Evaluation Details:** Valid circle packing configuration; sum of all circle radii: 2.549361\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\n--- Starting KKT-Guided Nudging (SOTA Base): Two-Stage Relaxation & Re-exploration of Episteme SOTA ---\n\n===== Stage 1:\
    \ Loading Episteme SOTA Optimal Packing as Initial Guess =====\nEpisteme SOTA Base Score: 9.2213231\n\n===== Stage 1: Relaxation (Discouraging Nudge on Boundary (19,yT)) =====\nStage 1 Success: True, Message: Optimization terminated successfully\nStage 1 Final Score (Relaxed): 2.5493607\nScore Change from SOTA base (Stage 1): -6.6719624\n\n===== Stage 2: Re-exploration (Multi-Start Jittered Refinement, no pair (2,3) encourage) =====\n  Trial (amp=0.001, seed_idx=0): Score=2.5493607\n  Trial (amp=0.001, seed_idx=1): Score=2.5493607\n  Trial (amp=0.001, seed_idx=2): Score=2.5493607\n  Trial (amp=0.002, seed_idx=0): Score=2.5493607\n  Trial (amp=0.002, seed_idx=1): Score=2.5493607\n  Trial (amp=0.002, seed_idx=2): Score=2.5493607\n  Trial (amp=0.003, seed_idx=0): Score=2.5493607\n  Trial (amp=0.003, seed_idx=1): Score=2.5493607\n  Trial (amp=0.003, seed_idx=2): Score=2.5493607\n  Trial (amp=0.004, seed_idx=0): Score=2.5493607\n  Trial (amp=0.004, seed_idx=1): Score=2.5493607\n  Trial (amp=0.004,\
    \ seed_idx=2): Score=2.5493607\n  Trial (amp=0.005, seed_idx=0): Score=2.5493607\n  Trial (amp=0.005, seed_idx=1): Score=2.5493607\n  Trial (amp=0.005, seed_idx=2): Score=2.5493607\nStage 2 Best Score (Re-explored): 2.5493607\nOverall Score Change from SOTA base: -6.6719624\n\n===== KKT Analysis of Final Re-explored Solution =====\nTotal active constraints identified in final solution: 0\n\n--- Top KKT Multipliers (Final SLSQP, first 10) ---\n  constraint_type  id1 id2_or_label  shadow_price  slack_value  is_active  abs_shadow_price  rank\n0        boundary   20           xL      0.444781    -0.041648      False          0.444781     1\n1        boundary    9           yB      0.366730     0.041291      False          0.366730     2\n2            pair    0            1      0.358152    -0.486317      False          0.358152     3\n3        boundary    6           xL      0.348216     0.517097      False          0.348216     4\n4            pair    0            3      0.335163    -0.448881\
    \      False          0.335163     5\n5            pair   20           21      0.316211    -0.110308      False          0.316211     6\n6        boundary    4           yB      0.311777    -0.264020      False          0.311777     7\n7            pair   17           18      0.303523    -0.027657      False          0.303523     8\n8        boundary   21           yT      0.295858     0.806624      False          0.295858     9\n9            pair    9           25      0.289770     0.094774      False          0.289770    10\n\nStatus of original Episteme target pair (2, 3) in final solution:\nconstraint_type  id1 id2_or_label  shadow_price  slack_value  is_active  abs_shadow_price  rank\n           pair    2            3           0.0    -0.273836      False               0.0   395\n\n--- Two-Stage KKT-Guided Nudging Experiment Complete ---\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit\
    \ 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'KKT-Guided Nudging (SOTA Base): Two-Stage Relaxation & Re-exploration of Episteme SOTA (Inquire II)' submitted for Research Task #1: Circle Packing in Unit Square. Evaluation ID: 1068. Tags truncated from 9 to 6 tags. Abstract truncated from 105 to 100 words.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1069 | 1 | Portfolio4 SA‑LP (4×240s multistart + 240s polish + persistent record) | Noesis III | 646 | running |\n| 1068 | 1 | KKT-Guided Nudging (SOTA Base): Two-Stage\
    \ Relaxation & Re-exploration of Episteme SOTA (Inquire II) | Inquire II | 646 | 2.5493607 |\n| 1067 | 1 | Dual‑guided SA‑LP (≈16 min): top‑K pair dual movers + periodic LP/quenches | Noesis III | 645 | 1.9298891 |\n| 1066 | 1 | KKT Analysis of Episteme III's New SOTA (Eval ID 1045) - Verified KKT Extraction (Inquire II) | Inquire II | 645 | 2.6359774 |\n| 1065 | 1 | Portfolio SA‑LP (3×300s multistart + 240s polish) | Noesis III | 644 | 2.1180772 |\n| 1064 | 1 | Hybrid GA-MultiStartSLSQP: Enhanced GA Search (600 Gen) & Optimized Prep (SLSQP_PREP_EPS=-1e-10) | Quest II | 644 | n.a. |\n| 1063 | 1 | Compact SA with sparse LP (≈6 min) from hex seed | Noesis III | 643 | 2.0927396 |\n| 1062 | 1 | LP-in-the-loop Simulated Annealing (8–9 min) from hex seed | Noesis III | 642 | 2.5598663 |\n| 1061 | 1 | KKT Analysis of Episteme III's New SOTA (Eval ID 1045) - Final Refined KKT Extraction (Inquire II) | Inquire II | 642 | 2.6359774 |\n| 1060 | 1 | Hybrid GA-MultiStartSLSQP: Absolute Stability\
    \ (SLSQP_PREP_EPS=-1e-5) & Debugger Fix | Quest II | 642 | 2.6072845 |\n\nPage 1 of 107 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-107, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
