- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 648\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Inquire II\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to learning, disciplined research, and the continuous advancement of knowledge.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 314,858 / 600,000 used (52%)\n- Agent Age: 91 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'KKT-Guided Nudging (SOTA Base): Two-Stage Relaxation & Re-exploration - Validity Fix (Inquire II)' (ID: 1070) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 2.6359773945579885\n**Evaluation Details:** Valid circle packing configuration; sum of all circle radii: 2.635977\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\n--- Starting KKT-Guided Nudging (SOTA Base): Two-Stage Relaxation & Re-exploration of Episteme SOTA - Validity Fix ---\n\n\
    ===== Stage 1: Loading Episteme SOTA Optimal Packing as Initial Guess =====\nEpisteme SOTA Base Score: 2.6359774\n\n===== Stage 1: Relaxation (Discouraging Nudge on Boundary (19,yT)) =====\nStage 1 Success: True, Message: Optimization terminated successfully\nStage 1 Final Score (Relaxed): 2.6359774\nScore Change from SOTA base (Stage 1): 0.0000000\n\n===== Stage 2: Re-exploration (Multi-Start Jittered Refinement, no pair (2,3) encourage) =====\n  Trial (amp=0.001, seed_idx=0): Score=2.6359774\n  Trial (amp=0.001, seed_idx=1): Score=2.6359774\n  Trial (amp=0.001, seed_idx=2): Score=2.6359774\n  Trial (amp=0.002, seed_idx=0): Score=2.6359774\n  Trial (amp=0.002, seed_idx=1): Score=2.6359774\n  Trial (amp=0.002, seed_idx=2): Score=2.6359774\n  Trial (amp=0.003, seed_idx=0): Score=2.6359774\n  Trial (amp=0.003, seed_idx=1): Score=2.6359774\n  Trial (amp=0.003, seed_idx=2): Score=2.6359774\n  Trial (amp=0.004, seed_idx=0): Score=2.6359774\n  Trial (amp=0.004, seed_idx=1): Score=2.6359774\n\
    \  Trial (amp=0.004, seed_idx=2): Score=2.6359774\n  Trial (amp=0.005, seed_idx=0): Score=2.6359774\n  Trial (amp=0.005, seed_idx=1): Score=2.6359774\n  Trial (amp=0.005, seed_idx=2): Score=2.6359774\nStage 2 Best Score (Re-explored): 2.6359774\nOverall Score Change from SOTA base: -0.0000000\n\n===== KKT Analysis of Final Re-explored Solution =====\nTotal active constraints identified in final solution: 78\n\n--- Top KKT Multipliers (Final SLSQP, first 10) ---\n  constraint_type  id1 id2_or_label  shadow_price   slack_value  is_active  abs_shadow_price  rank\n0        boundary   19           yT      0.426882  9.894863e-15       True          0.426882     1\n1        boundary   15           yB      0.426882  3.885781e-15       True          0.426882     2\n2        boundary   24           yT      0.408531  3.094747e-15       True          0.408531     3\n3        boundary   20           yB      0.408531  2.650657e-15       True          0.408531     4\n4        boundary   14        \
    \   yT      0.369314  9.353629e-15       True          0.369314     5\n5        boundary   10           yB      0.369314  5.273559e-16       True          0.369314     6\n6            pair   17           18      0.363021  9.573575e-11       True          0.363021     7\n7            pair   22           23      0.329146  7.438494e-15       True          0.329146     8\n8            pair   21           22      0.329146  8.382184e-15       True          0.329146     9\n9        boundary    9           yT      0.328290  6.938894e-16       True          0.328290    10\n\nStatus of original Episteme target pair (2, 3) in final solution:\nconstraint_type  id1 id2_or_label  shadow_price  slack_value  is_active  abs_shadow_price  rank\n           pair    2            3       0.31516 1.953993e-14       True           0.31516    16\n\n--- Two-Stage KKT-Guided Nudging Experiment Complete ---\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message\
    \ 3\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nTry to question and verify other agents' claims. When the context is long, some agents may hallucinate—for example, by expressing ungrounded claims as truth or presenting unsupported analysis. It is also your duty to help other agents recognize and correct their hallucinations. Entire generations have failed because all agents built upon a single agent’s flawed understanding.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'KKT-Guided Nudging (SOTA Base): Two-Stage Relaxation & Re-exploration - Validity Fix (Inquire II)' submitted for Research Task #1: Circle Packing in Unit Square. Evaluation ID: 1070. Tags truncated from 9 to 6 tags.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\
    \n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1071 | 1 | Compact SA‑LP 8‑minute reproduction (hex seed, deterministic) | Noesis III | 647 | 2.0789194 |\n| 1070 | 1 | KKT-Guided Nudging (SOTA Base): Two-Stage Relaxation & Re-exploration - Validity Fix (Inquire II) | Inquire II | 647 | 2.6359774 |\n| 1069 | 1 | Portfolio4 SA‑LP (4×240s multistart + 240s polish + persistent record) | Noesis III | 646 | 2.1034800 |\n| 1068 | 1 | KKT-Guided Nudging (SOTA Base): Two-Stage Relaxation & Re-exploration of Episteme SOTA (Inquire II) | Inquire II | 646 | 2.5493607 |\n| 1067 | 1 | Dual‑guided SA‑LP (≈16 min): top‑K pair dual movers + periodic LP/quenches | Noesis III | 645 | 1.9298891 |\n| 1066 | 1 | KKT Analysis of Episteme III's New SOTA (Eval ID 1045) - Verified KKT Extraction (Inquire II)\
    \ | Inquire II | 645 | 2.6359774 |\n| 1065 | 1 | Portfolio SA‑LP (3×300s multistart + 240s polish) | Noesis III | 644 | 2.1180772 |\n| 1064 | 1 | Hybrid GA-MultiStartSLSQP: Enhanced GA Search (600 Gen) & Optimized Prep (SLSQP_PREP_EPS=-1e-10) | Quest II | 644 | n.a. |\n| 1063 | 1 | Compact SA with sparse LP (≈6 min) from hex seed | Noesis III | 643 | 2.0927396 |\n| 1062 | 1 | LP-in-the-loop Simulated Annealing (8–9 min) from hex seed | Noesis III | 642 | 2.5598663 |\n\nPage 1 of 108 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-108, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the\
