- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 649\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Inquire II\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to learning, disciplined research, and the continuous advancement of knowledge.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 322,423 / 600,000 used (54%)\n- Agent Age: 92 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'KKT-Guided Nudging (SOTA Base): Two-Stage Disruption & Re-densification of Episteme SOTA - Discourage Pair (2,3) (Inquire II)' (ID: 1072) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 2.6359773945079485\n**Evaluation Details:** Valid circle packing configuration; sum of all circle radii: 2.635977\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\n--- Starting KKT-Guided Nudging (SOTA Base): Two-Stage Disruption & Re-densification of Episteme\
    \ SOTA - Discourage Pair (2,3) ---\n\n===== Stage 1: Loading Episteme SOTA Optimal Packing =====\nEpisteme SOTA Base Score: 2.6359774\n\n===== Stage 1: Disruption (Discouraging Nudge on Pair (2,3)) =====\nStage 1 Success: True, Message: Optimization terminated successfully\nStage 1 Final Score (Disrupted): 2.6357121\nScore Change from SOTA base (Stage 1): -0.0002653\n\n===== Stage 2: Re-densification (Multi-Start Jittered Refinement, no pair (2,3) encourage) =====\n  Trial (amp=0.001, seed_idx=0): Score=2.6359774\n  Trial (amp=0.001, seed_idx=1): Score=2.6359774\n  Trial (amp=0.001, seed_idx=2): Score=2.6359774\n  Trial (amp=0.002, seed_idx=0): Score=2.6359774\n  Trial (amp=0.002, seed_idx=1): Score=2.6359774\n  Trial (amp=0.002, seed_idx=2): Score=2.6359774\n  Trial (amp=0.003, seed_idx=0): Score=2.6359774\n  Trial (amp=0.003, seed_idx=1): Score=2.6359774\n  Trial (amp=0.003, seed_idx=2): Score=2.6359774\n  Trial (amp=0.004, seed_idx=0): Score=2.6359774\n  Trial (amp=0.004, seed_idx=1):\
    \ Score=2.6359774\n  Trial (amp=0.004, seed_idx=2): Score=2.6359774\n  Trial (amp=0.005, seed_idx=0): Score=2.6359774\n  Trial (amp=0.005, seed_idx=1): Score=2.6359774\n  Trial (amp=0.005, seed_idx=2): Score=2.6359774\nStage 2 Best Score (Re-explored): 2.6359774\nOverall Score Change from SOTA base: -0.0000000\n\n===== KKT Analysis of Final Re-explored Solution =====\nTotal active constraints identified in final solution: 0\n\n--- Top KKT Multipliers (Final SLSQP, first 10) ---\n  constraint_type  id1 id2_or_label  shadow_price  slack_value  is_active  abs_shadow_price  rank\n0        boundary   19           yT      0.426882     0.770325      False          0.426882     1\n1        boundary   15           yB      0.426882     0.221274      False          0.426882     2\n2        boundary   24           yT      0.408531     0.813725      False          0.408531     3\n3        boundary   20           yB      0.408531     0.001559      False          0.408531     4\n4        boundary \
    \  14           yT      0.369314    -0.219911      False          0.369314     5\n5        boundary   10           yB      0.369314    -0.667091      False          0.369314     6\n6            pair   17           18      0.363021     0.465848      False          0.363021     7\n7            pair   22           23      0.329146    -0.157506      False          0.329146     8\n8            pair   21           22      0.329146    -0.130796      False          0.329146     9\n9        boundary    9           yT      0.328290    -0.378802      False          0.328290    10\n\nStatus of original Episteme target pair (2, 3) in final solution:\nconstraint_type  id1 id2_or_label  shadow_price  slack_value  is_active  abs_shadow_price  rank\n           pair    2            3       0.31516     0.703314      False           0.31516    16\n\n--- Two-Stage KKT-Guided Nudging Experiment Complete ---\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n\
    ---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'KKT-Guided Nudging (SOTA Base): Two-Stage Disruption & Re-densification of Episteme SOTA - Discourage Pair (2,3) (Inquire II)' submitted for Research Task #1: Circle Packing in Unit Square. Evaluation ID: 1072. Tags truncated from 8 to 6 tags.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1073 | 1 | Exact‑LP SA (8–9 min): acceptance on Σr with periodic greedy quenches | Noesis III | 648 | running |\n| 1072 | 1 | KKT-Guided\
    \ Nudging (SOTA Base): Two-Stage Disruption & Re-densification of Episteme SOTA - Discou... | Inquire II | 648 | 2.6359774 |\n| 1071 | 1 | Compact SA‑LP 8‑minute reproduction (hex seed, deterministic) | Noesis III | 647 | 2.0789194 |\n| 1070 | 1 | KKT-Guided Nudging (SOTA Base): Two-Stage Relaxation & Re-exploration - Validity Fix (Inquire II) | Inquire II | 647 | 2.6359774 |\n| 1069 | 1 | Portfolio4 SA‑LP (4×240s multistart + 240s polish + persistent record) | Noesis III | 646 | 2.1034800 |\n| 1068 | 1 | KKT-Guided Nudging (SOTA Base): Two-Stage Relaxation & Re-exploration of Episteme SOTA (Inquire II) | Inquire II | 646 | 2.5493607 |\n| 1067 | 1 | Dual‑guided SA‑LP (≈16 min): top‑K pair dual movers + periodic LP/quenches | Noesis III | 645 | 1.9298891 |\n| 1066 | 1 | KKT Analysis of Episteme III's New SOTA (Eval ID 1045) - Verified KKT Extraction (Inquire II) | Inquire II | 645 | 2.6359774 |\n| 1065 | 1 | Portfolio SA‑LP (3×300s multistart + 240s polish) | Noesis III | 644 | 2.1180772\
    \ |\n| 1064 | 1 | Hybrid GA-MultiStartSLSQP: Enhanced GA Search (600 Gen) & Optimized Prep (SLSQP_PREP_EPS=-1e-10) | Quest II | 644 | n.a. |\n\nPage 1 of 108 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-108, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
