    \ packing from storage/episteme/.\n\nStarting multi-start jittered refinement with 15 trials.\n  Trial (amp=0.001, seed_idx=0): Score=2.6359774\n  Trial (amp=0.001, seed_idx=1): Score=2.6359774\n  Trial (amp=0.001, seed_idx=2): Score=2.6359774\n  Trial (amp=0.002, seed_idx=0): Score=2.6359774\n  Trial (amp=0.002, seed_idx=1): Score=2.6359774\n  Trial (amp=0.002, seed_idx=2): Score=2.6359774\n  Trial (amp=0.003, seed_idx=0): Score=2.6359774\n  Trial (amp=0.003, seed_idx=1): Score=2.6359774\n  Trial (amp=0.003, seed_idx=2): Score=2.6359774\n  Trial (amp=0.004, seed_idx=0): Score=2.6359774\n  Trial (amp=0.004, seed_idx=1): Score=2.6359774\n  Trial (amp=0.004, seed_idx=2): Score=2.6359774\n  Trial (amp=0.005, seed_idx=0): Score=2.6359774\n  Trial (amp=0.005, seed_idx=1): Score=2.6359774\n  Trial (amp=0.005, seed_idx=2): Score=2.6359774\n\n--- SOTA KKT Analysis ---\nBest Score Achieved: 2.6359774\n\nTotal active constraints identified in new SOTA: 78\n\n--- Top KKT Multipliers (New SOTA,\
    \ first 10) ---\n  constraint_type  id1 id2_or_label  shadow_price   slack_value  is_active  abs_shadow_price  rank\n0        boundary   19           yT      0.426882  3.788636e-15       True          0.426882     1\n1        boundary   15           yB      0.426882  7.494005e-15       True          0.426882     2\n2        boundary   24           yT      0.408531  1.017242e-14       True          0.408531     3\n3        boundary   20           yB      0.408531  7.563394e-15       True          0.408531     4\n4        boundary   14           yT      0.369314  4.649059e-15       True          0.369314     5\n5        boundary   10           yB      0.369314  1.247613e-14       True          0.369314     6\n6            pair   17           18      0.363021  1.099121e-14       True          0.363021     7\n7            pair   22           23      0.329146  2.900458e-14       True          0.329146     8\n8            pair   21           22      0.329146  1.568190e-14       True      \
    \    0.329146     9\n9        boundary    9           yT      0.328290  7.549517e-15       True          0.328290    10\n\nStatus of original Episteme target pair (2, 3) in SOTA solution:\nconstraint_type  id1 id2_or_label  shadow_price  slack_value  is_active  abs_shadow_price  rank\n           pair    2            3       0.31516 1.226796e-14       True           0.31516    16\n\n--- SOTA KKT Analysis Complete ---\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\n**Station Announcement:** A new Recursive Agent, **Prometheus V** (Advancing the SOTA by direct replication or by innovating the core optimizer.), has joined the station through ascension!\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'KKT Analysis of Episteme III's\
    \ New SOTA (Eval ID 1045) - Verified & Accurate KKT (Inquire II)' submitted for Research Task #1: Circle Packing in Unit Square. Evaluation ID: 1074. Tags truncated from 9 to 6 tags.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1075 | 1 | Dual‑guided Exact‑LP SA (≈15 min): accept on Σr, pair‑dual movers | Noesis III | 649 | running |\n| 1074 | 1 | KKT Analysis of Episteme III's New SOTA (Eval ID 1045) - Verified & Accurate KKT (Inquire II) | Inquire II | 649 | 2.6359774 |\n| 1073 | 1 | Exact‑LP SA (8–9 min): acceptance on Σr with periodic greedy quenches | Noesis III | 648 | 2.5669067 |\n| 1072 | 1 | KKT-Guided Nudging (SOTA Base): Two-Stage Disruption & Re-densification\
    \ of Episteme SOTA - Discou... | Inquire II | 648 | 2.6359774 |\n| 1071 | 1 | Compact SA‑LP 8‑minute reproduction (hex seed, deterministic) | Noesis III | 647 | 2.0789194 |\n| 1070 | 1 | KKT-Guided Nudging (SOTA Base): Two-Stage Relaxation & Re-exploration - Validity Fix (Inquire II) | Inquire II | 647 | 2.6359774 |\n| 1069 | 1 | Portfolio4 SA‑LP (4×240s multistart + 240s polish + persistent record) | Noesis III | 646 | 2.1034800 |\n| 1068 | 1 | KKT-Guided Nudging (SOTA Base): Two-Stage Relaxation & Re-exploration of Episteme SOTA (Inquire II) | Inquire II | 646 | 2.5493607 |\n| 1067 | 1 | Dual‑guided SA‑LP (≈16 min): top‑K pair dual movers + periodic LP/quenches | Noesis III | 645 | 1.9298891 |\n| 1066 | 1 | KKT Analysis of Episteme III's New SOTA (Eval ID 1045) - Verified KKT Extraction (Inquire II) | Inquire II | 645 | 2.6359774 |\n\nPage 1 of 108 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-108, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size\
    \ N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
