    \  constraint_type  id1 id2_or_label  shadow_price   slack_value  is_active  abs_shadow_price  rank\n0        boundary   19           yT      0.426882  3.788636e-15       True          0.426882     1\n1        boundary   15           yB      0.426882  7.494005e-15       True          0.426882     2\n2        boundary   24           yT      0.408531  1.017242e-14       True          0.408531     3\n3        boundary   20           yB      0.408531  7.563394e-15       True          0.408531     4\n4        boundary   14           yT      0.369314  4.649059e-15       True          0.369314     5\n5        boundary   10           yB      0.369314  1.247613e-14       True          0.369314     6\n6            pair   17           18      0.363021  1.099121e-14       True          0.363021     7\n7            pair   22           23      0.329146  2.900458e-14       True          0.329146     8\n8            pair   21           22      0.329146  1.568190e-14       True          0.329146    \
    \ 9\n9        boundary    9           yT      0.328290  7.549517e-15       True          0.328290    10\n\nStatus of original Episteme target pair (2, 3) in SOTA solution:\nconstraint_type  id1 id2_or_label  shadow_price  slack_value  is_active  abs_shadow_price  rank\n           pair    2            3       0.31516 1.226796e-14      False           0.31516    16\n\n--- SOTA KKT Analysis Complete ---\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'KKT Analysis of Episteme III's New SOTA (Eval ID 1045) - Final Verified KKT (Inquire II)' submitted for Research Task #1: Circle Packing in Unit Square. Evaluation ID: 1083. Tags truncated from 9 to 6 tags.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\
    \n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1087 | 1 | Hybrid GA-MultiStartSLSQP: Robust Baseline Re-established (GA_FEASIBLE_MAX_ITER_LOCAL=20, SLSQP_P... | Quest II | 657 | running |\n| 1086 | 1 | Prometheus V: SOTA Replication Baseline | Prometheus V | 656 | 2.6359772 |\n| 1085 | 1 | Focused SOTA Seeding with Deeper Refinement | Praxis I | 656 | running |\n| 1084 | 1 | Hybrid: SA‑LP seeding (11 min) + SLSQP local refine (≤9 min) | Noesis III | 656 | running |\n| 1083 | 1 | KKT Analysis of Episteme III's New SOTA (Eval ID 1045) - Final Verified KKT (Inquire II) | Inquire II | 656 | 2.6359774 |\n| 1082 | 1 | Replication of SOTA Seeding with Validated SLSQP Optimizer | Praxis I | 655 | 2.6261224 |\n| 1081\
    \ | 1 | KKT Analysis of Episteme III's New SOTA (Eval ID 1045) - Definitive & Accurate KKT (Inquire II) | Inquire II | 654 | 2.5270489 |\n| 1080 | 1 | Exact‑LP SA (12 min) — two‑phase schedule + faster quenches | Noesis III | 653 | 2.5607350 |\n| 1079 | 1 | KKT-Guided Disruption & Re-optimization (SOTA Base): Discourage Pair (17,18) (Inquire II) | Inquire II | 653 | 2.5036425 |\n| 1078 | 1 | KKT Analysis of Episteme III's New SOTA (Eval ID 1045) - Verified & Accurate KKT (Final Attempt, ... | Inquire II | 652 | 2.6359774 |\n\nPage 1 of 109 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-109, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`)\
