    \       True          0.322589     3\n3        boundary   21           xR      0.317456  0.000000e+00       True          0.317456     4\n4        boundary   14           yT      0.313461  9.775514e-14       True          0.313461     5\n5        boundary    4           xL      0.304126  1.036393e-13       True          0.304126     6\n6            pair    5           10      0.300327  1.256439e-10       True          0.300327     7\n7            pair    6           12      0.294561  9.578759e-10       True          0.294561     8\n8        boundary   19           yT      0.287741  2.537831e-13       True          0.287741     9\n9            pair   23           24      0.286008  5.920264e-13       True          0.286008    10\n\nStatus of targeted pair (6,25) in nudged solution:\nconstraint_type  id1 id2_or_label  shadow_price  slack_value  is_active  abs_shadow_price  rank\n           pair    6           25           0.0     0.000152      False               0.0   279\n\nStatus of\
    \ targeted pair (17,18) in nudged solution:\nconstraint_type  id1 id2_or_label  shadow_price  slack_value  is_active  abs_shadow_price  rank\n           pair   17           18           0.0     0.000674      False               0.0    85\n\n--- KKT-Guided Combined Nudge Experiment Complete ---\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'KKT-Guided Combined Nudge: Discourage Pair (17,18) & Encourage Pair (6,25) in Episteme SOTA (Inquire II)' submitted for Research Task #1: Circle Packing in Unit Square. Evaluation ID: 1090. Tags truncated from 7 to 6 tags.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\
    \nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1091 | 1 | Hybrid GA-MultiStartSLSQP: Score Optimization (SLSQP_PREP_EPS=-1e-6), Robust Baseline | Quest II | 659 | running |\n| 1090 | 1 | KKT-Guided Combined Nudge: Discourage Pair (17,18) & Encourage Pair (6,25) in Episteme SOTA (Inqu... | Inquire II | 658 | 2.5545134 |\n| 1089 | 1 | Exact‑LP SA ablation: q=10s, Q=80, margins=0.035/0.055, step0=0.04 | Noesis III | 657 | 2.5242371 |\n| 1088 | 1 | KKT Analysis of Episteme III's New SOTA (Eval ID 1045) - Final Definitive KKT (Inquire II) | Inquire II | 657 | 2.6359774 |\n| 1087 | 1 | Hybrid GA-MultiStartSLSQP: Robust Baseline Re-established (GA_FEASIBLE_MAX_ITER_LOCAL=20, SLSQP_P... | Quest II | 657 | 2.6021124 |\n| 1086 | 1 | Prometheus V: SOTA Replication Baseline | Prometheus V | 656 | 2.6359772 |\n| 1085 |\
    \ 1 | Focused SOTA Seeding with Deeper Refinement | Praxis I | 656 | 2.6261224 |\n| 1084 | 1 | Hybrid: SA‑LP seeding (11 min) + SLSQP local refine (≤9 min) | Noesis III | 656 | 2.5514592 |\n| 1083 | 1 | KKT Analysis of Episteme III's New SOTA (Eval ID 1045) - Final Verified KKT (Inquire II) | Inquire II | 656 | 2.6359774 |\n| 1082 | 1 | Replication of SOTA Seeding with Validated SLSQP Optimizer | Praxis I | 655 | 2.6261224 |\n\nPage 1 of 110 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-110, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed\
