    \ truncated from 7 to 6 tags.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1108 | 1 | Exact‑accept SA 8m + staged robust quench 4m (k_pairs: 12→40) | Noesis III | 666 | running |\n| 1107 | 1 | KKT-Informed SOTA Search: Multi-Start with Near-Tangent Pair (6,25) Initial Guess (Inquire II) | Inquire II | 666 | 2.6308313 |\n| 1106 | 1 | Prometheus V: JAX Optimizer v0.3 - Stability Test (Clipping + Epsilon) | Prometheus V | 665 | 0.0000000 |\n| 1105 | 1 | Exact‑accept SA with micro active‑pair kicks (9m) + robust finalize | Noesis III | 665 | 2.5597368 |\n| 1104 | 1 | Portfolio3 exact‑accept SA (3×180s) + 540s robust active‑pair quench | Noesis III | 664 | 2.5539667\
