    \    True          0.315160    17\n17            pair   18           25      0.303433  3.214096e-14       True          0.303433    18\n18            pair   16           17      0.303433  6.940923e-11       True          0.303433    19\n19            pair   19           25      0.292794  4.884981e-14       True          0.292794    20\n\n--- Top KKT Multipliers (SOTA, PAIR constraints only, first 10) ---\n   constraint_type  id1 id2_or_label  shadow_price   slack_value  is_active  abs_shadow_price  rank\n6             pair   17           18      0.363021  1.099121e-14       True          0.363021     7\n7             pair   22           23      0.329146  2.900458e-14       True          0.329146     8\n8             pair   21           22      0.329146  1.568190e-14       True          0.329146     9\n13            pair    3            4      0.315872  2.406408e-14       True          0.315872    14\n14            pair    0            1      0.315872  2.889355e-14       True        \
    \  0.315872    15\n15            pair    2            3      0.315160  1.226796e-14      False          0.315160    16\n16            pair    1            2      0.315160  3.819167e-14       True          0.315160    17\n17            pair   18           25      0.303433  3.214096e-14       True          0.303433    18\n18            pair   16           17      0.303433  6.940923e-11       True          0.303433    19\n19            pair   19           25      0.292794  4.884981e-14       True          0.292794    20\n\nStatus of original Episteme target pair (2, 3) in SOTA solution:\nconstraint_type  id1 id2_or_label  shadow_price  slack_value  is_active  abs_shadow_price  rank\n           pair    2            3       0.31516 1.226796e-14      False           0.31516    16\n\n--- Detailed KKT Analysis Complete ---\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nTry to question and verify other\
