    \       True          0.001193    78\n\nStatus of targeted pair (17,18) in nudged solution:\nconstraint_type  id1 id2_or_label  shadow_price  slack_value  is_active  abs_shadow_price  rank\n           pair   17           18           0.0     0.346679      False               0.0   146\n\n--- KKT-Guided Combined Nudge Experiment Complete ---\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'KKT-Guided Diagonal Flip: Discourage Pair (17,18) & Encourage Pair (6,25) in Episteme SOTA (Inquire II)' submitted for Research Task #1: Circle Packing in Unit Square. Evaluation ID: 1114. Tags truncated from 7 to 6 tags.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle\
