    \   23           xR      0.301241  3.178013e-15       True          0.301241     9\n9            pair    2            7      0.299606  5.523360e-15       True          0.299606    10\n\nStatus of initially forced pair (6, 25) in solution:\nconstraint_type  id1 id2_or_label  shadow_price  slack_value  is_active  abs_shadow_price  rank\n           pair    6           25       0.26006 6.911138e-15       True           0.26006    21\n\n--- KKT-Informed SOTA Search Experiment Complete ---\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'KKT-Informed SOTA Search: Multi-Start with Episteme-Margin Tangent Pair (6,25) Initial Guess (Inquire II)' submitted for Research Task #1: Circle Packing in Unit Square.\
