parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 675\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Inquire II\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to learning, disciplined research, and the continuous advancement of knowledge.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 436,467 / 600,000 used (73%)\n- Agent Age: 118 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'KKT-Informed SOTA Search: Multi-Start with Strict Tangency for Pairs (2,3) & (6,25) Initial Guess (Inquire II)' (ID: 1126) succeeded after automatic debugging.\n\n**Score:** 0.0\n**Evaluation Details:** Verification failed: Circles 5 and 11 overlap: dist=0.09972469833117616, r1+r2=0.11191655533231701\n\n**Debugger Report:** # Debug Report for Evaluation 1126\n\n## Summary\n**SUCCESS** - Fixed two bugs that prevented code execution. The code now\
    \ runs to completion without crashing.\n\n## Root Cause\nThe original submission had two distinct bugs:\n\n1. **Bug in imported lineage function** (`storage/inquire/circle_packing/initial_guesses_kkt_informed.py:49`):\n   - Line 49 referenced undefined variable `amp` instead of the parameter name `jitter_amp`\n   - Error: `NameError: name 'amp' is not defined`\n   - This occurred in the `generate_kkt_informed_episteme_seed()` function\n\n2. **Missing import in main submission**:\n   - The code called `z_to_cr(res.x)` on line 39\n   - But only imported `pack_to_z, z_to_pack, objective` from `slsqp_utils`\n   - The function `z_to_cr` exists in `episteme_sota_utils` but was not imported\n\n## Fix Applied\nCreated `submissions/submission_v2.py` with the following corrections:\n\n1. **Fixed the lineage function bug**:\n   - Since `storage/inquire/` is READ-ONLY, copied the buggy `generate_kkt_informed_episteme_seed()` function into the submission\n   - Changed line: `jitter = np.random.uniform(-jitter_amp,\
    \ amp, size=base_centers.shape)`\n   - To: `jitter = np.random.uniform(-jitter_amp, jitter_amp, size=base_centers.shape)`\n   - Kept import for `make_pair_tangent` which works correctly\n\n2. **Added missing import**:\n   - Changed: `from episteme_sota_utils import _ensure_validity`\n   - To: `from episteme_sota_utils import _ensure_validity, z_to_cr`\n\n## Execution Results\nThe fixed code now runs successfully:\n- Completed all 15 multi-start optimization trials\n- Best score achieved: 1.1432298\n- Generated full KKT analysis output\n- Code executed to completion without any runtime errors\n\n**Note**: The verification system flagged overlapping circles (5 and 11), but this is a result quality issue, not a code execution error. The algorithm completed successfully and produced a valid result tuple.\n\n\n**Important Note:** The debugger cannot modify files in your lineage storage. If your code relies on lineage files, you may need to update them manually.\n\n**Debugged Code (version\
    \ v2):**\n```python\nimport numpy as np\nfrom scipy.optimize import minimize\nimport sys\nimport pandas as pd\n\nsys.path.append('storage/inquire/circle_packing')\n\nfrom slsqp_utils import pack_to_z, z_to_pack, objective\nfrom config import N_CIRCLES, SLSQP_OPTIONS, BOUNDS, CONSTRAINTS_FOR_SLSQP, SAFETY_FACTOR, TOL_VAL, ATOL_SLACK\nfrom kkt_analysis import extract_slsqp_kkt_multipliers\n\n# Fixed: Import z_to_cr from episteme_sota_utils\nfrom episteme_sota_utils import _ensure_validity, z_to_cr\n\n# Fixed: Copy and fix the buggy function from initial_guesses_kkt_informed.py\n# Only copying the buggy function, keeping imports for working functions\nfrom initial_guesses_kkt_informed import make_pair_tangent\n\ndef generate_kkt_informed_episteme_seed(base_centers, base_radii, jitter_amp=0.001, seed_idx=0,\n                                        target_pairs=[(2,3), (6,25)], tangent_margin=0.0):\n    \"\"\"\n    Generates an initial guess based on Episteme's base_416, with jitter,\n  \
    \  and attempts to make specified target pairs exactly tangent.\n    FIXED: Changed 'amp' to 'jitter_amp' on line 49 of original\n    \"\"\"\n    np.random.seed(int(jitter_amp*1e6) + seed_idx)\n\n    # FIXED: Changed 'amp' to 'jitter_amp' here\n    jitter = np.random.uniform(-jitter_amp, jitter_amp, size=base_centers.shape)\n    initial_centers_jittered = np.clip(base_centers + jitter, 1e-6, 1 - 1e-6)\n    initial_radii = base_radii.copy()\n\n    c_current, r_current = initial_centers_jittered, initial_radii\n\n    # Apply make_pair_tangent for each target pair sequentially\n    for pair in target_pairs:\n        c_current, r_current = make_pair_tangent(c_current, r_current,\n                                                 pair[0], pair[1],\n                                                 target_dist_margin=tangent_margin)\n\n    return c_current, r_current\n\ndef construct_packing() -> tuple:\n    print(\"--- Starting KKT-Informed SOTA Search: Multi-Start with Strict Tangency for\
    \ Pairs (2,3) & (6,25) Initial Guess ---\", file=sys.stdout)\n\n    N = N_CIRCLES\n\n    # Load base packing from Episteme's storage\n    try:\n        base_centers_episteme = np.loadtxt('storage/episteme/base_416_centers.txt')\n        base_radii_episteme = np.loadtxt('storage/episteme/base_416_radii.txt')\n        print(\"\\nSuccessfully loaded Episteme base packing from storage/episteme/.\", file=sys.stdout)\n    except Exception as e:\n        print(f\"\\nError loading Episteme base packing: {e}\", file=sys.stdout)\n        print(\"Falling back to random initialization.\", file=sys.stdout)\n        return np.random.rand(N_CIRCLES, 2), np.full(N_CIRCLES, 0.05)\n\n    # --- Multi-Start KKT-Informed Refinement ---\n    best_score = -np.inf\n    best_packing = (None, None)\n    best_res_object = None\n\n    jitter_amplitudes = [1.0e-3, 2.0e-3, 3.0e-3, 4.0e-3, 5.0e-3]\n    restarts_per_amplitude = 3\n\n    print(f\"\\nStarting multi-start KKT-informed refinement with {len(jitter_amplitudes)*restarts_per_amplitude}\
    \ trials.\", file=sys.stdout)\n\n    current_slsqp_options = SLSQP_OPTIONS.copy()\n    current_slsqp_options['maxiter'] = 1500\n\n    for amp in jitter_amplitudes:\n        for i in range(restarts_per_amplitude):\n            # Generate KKT-informed initial guess: multiple pairs strictly tangent (margin=0.0)\n            initial_centers_kkt, initial_radii_kkt = generate_kkt_informed_episteme_seed(\n                base_centers=base_centers_episteme,\n                base_radii=base_radii_episteme,\n                jitter_amp=amp,\n                seed_idx=i,\n                target_pairs=[(2,3), (6,25)], # Targeted pairs\n                tangent_margin=0.0\n            )\n\n            initial_z = pack_to_z(initial_centers_kkt, initial_radii_kkt)\n\n            res = minimize(\n                objective,\n                initial_z,\n                method='SLSQP',\n                bounds=BOUNDS,\n                constraints=CONSTRAINTS_FOR_SLSQP,\n                options=current_slsqp_options\n\
    \            )\n\n            if res.success:\n                c_res, r_res = z_to_cr(res.x)\n                c_final, r_final = _ensure_validity(c_res, r_res)\n                current_score = np.sum(r_final)\n                print(f\"  Trial (amp={amp}, seed_idx={i}): Score={current_score:.7f}\", file=sys.stdout)\n                if current_score > best_score:\n                    best_score = current_score\n                    best_packing = (c_final, r_final)\n                    best_res_object = res\n            else:\n                print(f\"  Trial (amp={amp}, seed_idx={i}): Optimization failed: {res.message}\", file=sys.stdout)\n\n\n    if best_packing[0] is None:\n        print(\"\\nMulti-start optimization failed to find any successful packing. Returning random.\", file=sys.stdout)\n        return np.random.rand(N_CIRCLES, 2), np.full(N_CIRCLES, 0.05)\n\n    print(f\"\\n--- KKT-Informed SOTA Search Complete ---\", file=sys.stdout)\n    print(f\"Best Score Achieved: {best_score:.7f}\"\
    , file=sys.stdout)\n\n    if best_res_object is not None:\n        try:\n            df_kkt = extract_slsqp_kkt_multipliers(best_res_object, N=N_CIRCLES, tol=TOL_VAL, atol_slack=ATOL_SLACK,\n                                                      final_centers=best_packing[0], final_radii=best_packing[1])\n            active_count = df_kkt['is_active'].sum()\n            print(f\"\\nTotal active constraints identified: {active_count}\", file=sys.stdout)\n            print(\"\\n--- Top KKT Multipliers (first 10) ---\", file=sys.stdout)\n            print(df_kkt.head(10).to_string(), file=sys.stdout)\n\n            # Check status of initially forced pairs\n            target_pairs_forced = [(2,3), (6,25)]\n            for target_pair_forced in target_pairs_forced:\n                target_pair_info = df_kkt[\n                    (df_kkt['constraint_type'] == 'pair') &\n                    (df_kkt['id1'] == target_pair_forced[0]) &\n                    (df_kkt['id2_or_label'] == target_pair_forced[1])\n\
    \                ]\n                if not target_pair_info.empty:\n                    print(f\"\\nStatus of initially forced pair {target_pair_forced} in solution:\", file=sys.stdout)\n                    print(target_pair_info.to_string(index=False), file=sys.stdout)\n                else:\n                    print(f\"\\nInitially forced pair {target_pair_forced} not found in KKT analysis or not a pair constraint type.\", file=sys.stdout)\n\n        except Exception as e:\n            print(f\"Error extracting KKT multipliers: {e}\", file=sys.stdout)\n\n    print(\"\\n--- KKT-Informed SOTA Search Experiment Complete ---\", file=sys.stdout)\n\n    return best_packing\n\n```\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\n--- Starting KKT-Informed SOTA Search: Multi-Start with Strict Tangency for Pairs (2,3) & (6,25) Initial Guess ---\n\nSuccessfully loaded Episteme base packing from storage/episteme/.\n\nStarting multi-start KKT-informed refinement with 15 trials.\n\
    \  Trial (amp=0.001, seed_idx=0): Score=1.0134100\n  Trial (amp=0.001, seed_idx=1): Score=1.0134100\n  Trial (amp=0.001, seed_idx=2): Score=1.1432298\n  Trial (amp=0.002, seed_idx=0): Score=1.0134100\n  Trial (amp=0.002, seed_idx=1): Score=1.0134100\n  Trial (amp=0.002, seed_idx=2): Score=1.0134100\n  Trial (amp=0.003, seed_idx=0): Score=1.0134100\n  Trial (amp=0.003, seed_idx=1): Score=1.0134100\n  Trial (amp=0.003, seed_idx=2): Score=0.9835347\n  Trial (amp=0.004, seed_idx=0): Score=1.0134100\n  Trial (amp=0.004, seed_idx=1): Score=0.9835347\n  Trial (amp=0.004, seed_idx=2): Score=0.9835347\n  Trial (amp=0.005, seed_idx=0): Score=1.0134100\n  Trial (amp=0.005, seed_idx=1): Score=1.0134100\n  Trial (amp=0.005, seed_idx=2): Score=1.0134100\n\n--- KKT-Informed SOTA Search Complete ---\nBest Score Achieved: 1.1432298\n\nTotal active constraints identified: 3\n\n--- Top KKT Multipliers (first 10) ---\n  constraint_type  id1 id2_or_label  shadow_price   slack_value  is_active  abs_shadow_price\
    \  rank\n0        boundary   14           xL      0.399636  1.187247e-01      False          0.399636     1\n1        boundary   20           yB      0.386649  9.868983e-02      False          0.386649     2\n2        boundary    8           xL      0.364090  5.367460e-01      False          0.364090     3\n3            pair   14           19      0.362281  3.789172e-11       True          0.362281     4\n4            pair   20           23      0.355862  9.593466e-02      False          0.355862     5\n5        boundary    0           yT      0.347511  4.036827e-02      False          0.347511     6\n6        boundary   18           yB      0.321981  5.850710e-01      False          0.321981     7\n7        boundary    9           yB      0.317025  8.282121e-01      False          0.317025     8\n8            pair    0            3      0.302814  7.900266e-01      False          0.302814     9\n9            pair   15           23      0.300594  7.277742e-01      False          0.300594\
    \    10\n\nStatus of initially forced pair (2, 3) in solution:\nconstraint_type  id1 id2_or_label  shadow_price  slack_value  is_active  abs_shadow_price  rank\n           pair    2            3           0.0     0.298725      False               0.0   395\n\nStatus of initially forced pair (6, 25) in solution:\nconstraint_type  id1 id2_or_label  shadow_price  slack_value  is_active  abs_shadow_price  rank\n           pair    6           25      0.088716     0.290456      False          0.088716    70\n\n--- KKT-Informed SOTA Search Experiment Complete ---\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'KKT-Informed SOTA Search: Multi-Start with Strict Tangency for Pairs (2,3) & (6,25) Initial\
    \ Guess (Inquire II)' submitted for Research Task #1: Circle Packing in Unit Square. Evaluation ID: 1126. Tags truncated from 7 to 6 tags.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1126 | 1 | KKT-Informed SOTA Search: Multi-Start with Strict Tangency for Pairs (2,3) & (6,25) Initial Guess... | Inquire II | 674 | 0.0000000 |\n| 1125 | 1 | Prometheus V: JAX Optimizer v1.2 - Final Validation (Projection) | Prometheus V | 673 | 2.6356279 |\n| 1124 | 1 | Ultra‑conservative robust polish from best artifact (≈19m) | Noesis III | 673 | 2.5705730 |\n| 1123 | 1 | Hybrid GA-MultiStartSLSQP: Enhanced Robustness (SLSQP_PREP_EPS=1e-8), Fundamental Fix Confirmed | Quest\
    \ II | 673 | 2.6023158 |\n| 1122 | 1 | KKT-Informed SOTA Search: Multi-Start with Strict Tangency for Pairs (17,18) & (22,23) Initial Gu... | Inquire II | 672 | 2.6359774 |\n| 1121 | 1 | Prometheus V: JAX Optimizer v1.1 - Fine-Tuning (Low LR) | Prometheus V | 671 | 0.0000000 |\n| 1120 | 1 | Polish and save artifact (12m robust quench) — best seed + NPZ export | Noesis III | 671 | 2.5680571 |\n| 1119 | 1 | Hybrid GA-MultiStartSLSQP: Fundamental Robustness Fix (SLSQP_PREP_EPS=1e-9, SLSQP_PREP_MAX_ITER_L... | Quest II | 671 | 2.6285371 |\n| 1118 | 1 | KKT-Informed SOTA Search: Multi-Start with Episteme-Margin Tangent Pair (6,25) Initial Guess (Inq... | Inquire II | 670 | 2.6308313 |\n| 1117 | 1 | Prometheus V: JAX Optimizer v0.5 - Tuning (LR Schedule + Logging) | Prometheus V | 669 | 0.0000000 |\n\nPage 1 of 113 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-113, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter\
    \ tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
