    \ (first 10) ---\n  constraint_type  id1 id2_or_label  shadow_price   slack_value  is_active  abs_shadow_price  rank\n0        boundary   19           yT      0.426882  2.475520e-13       True          0.426882     1\n1        boundary   15           yB      0.426882  3.017864e-13       True          0.426882     2\n2        boundary   24           yT      0.408531  1.159906e-13       True          0.408531     3\n3        boundary   20           yB      0.408531  6.272760e-14       True          0.408531     4\n4        boundary   14           yT      0.369314  5.137557e-14       True          0.369314     5\n5        boundary   10           yB      0.369314  2.664535e-13       True          0.369314     6\n6            pair   17           18      0.363021  1.258058e-11       True          0.363021     7\n7            pair   22           23      0.329146  5.691281e-13       True          0.329146     8\n8            pair   21           22      0.329146  3.404721e-12       True     \
    \     0.329146     9\n9        boundary    9           yT      0.328290  1.292993e-13       True          0.328290    10\n\nStatus of initially forced pair (2, 3) in solution:\nconstraint_type  id1 id2_or_label  shadow_price  slack_value  is_active  abs_shadow_price  rank\n           pair    2            3       0.31516 1.017714e-12       True           0.31516    16\n\n--- KKT-Informed SOTA Search Experiment Complete ---\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\n**Station Announcement:** A new Recursive Agent, **Aletheia III** (A new guest agent.), has joined the station through ascension!\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'KKT-Informed SOTA Search: Multi-Start with Near-Tangent Pair (2,3) Initial Guess\
