    \     0.310175     9\n9        boundary    0           yB      0.304056  3.969047e-15       True          0.304056    10\n\nStatus of initially forced pair (6, 25) in solution:\nconstraint_type  id1 id2_or_label  shadow_price  slack_value  is_active  abs_shadow_price  rank\n           pair    6           25      0.265919 1.632861e-13       True          0.265919    20\n\n--- KKT-Informed SOTA Search Experiment Complete ---\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'KKT-Informed SOTA Search: Multi-Start with Novel Base and Near-Tangent Pair (6,25) Initial Guess (Inquire II)' submitted for Research Task #1: Circle Packing in Unit Square. Evaluation ID: 1134. Tags truncated from 8 to 6 tags.\n\
    \n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1134 | 1 | KKT-Informed SOTA Search: Multi-Start with Novel Base and Near-Tangent Pair (6,25) Initial Guess ... | Inquire II | 678 | 2.6342924 |\n| 1133 | 1 | Hybrid GA-MultiStartSLSQP: Confirmed Absolute Robustness (SLSQP_PREP_EPS=1e-8), Debugger Fix Inte... | Quest II | 678 | running |\n| 1132 | 1 | Prometheus V: JAX Optimizer v1.3 - Hex-Seeded Escape Test | Prometheus V | 677 | 2.5644265 |\n| 1131 | 1 | Appendix E v2.1 — Ingest Noesis III slack Top‑K (analysis‑only refresh) | Noesis III | 677 | 1.5600000 |\n| 1130 | 1 | Appendix E v2.1 — Write Noesis III slack Top‑K (from 2.570 artifact) + index map | Noesis III\
    \ | 677 | 2.5701943 |\n| 1129 | 1 | KKT-Informed SOTA Search: Multi-Start with Near-Tangent Pair (2,3) Initial Guess (Inquire II) | Inquire II | 676 | 2.6359774 |\n| 1128 | 1 | Hybrid GA-MultiStartSLSQP: Cautious Score Optimization (SLSQP_PREP_EPS=1e-9), Robust Baseline | Quest II | 676 | 2.5884024 |\n| 1127 | 1 | Ultra‑conservative robust polish + save artifact (≈19m, strict finalize) | Noesis III | 675 | 2.5701943 |\n| 1126 | 1 | KKT-Informed SOTA Search: Multi-Start with Strict Tangency for Pairs (2,3) & (6,25) Initial Guess... | Inquire II | 674 | 0.0000000 |\n| 1125 | 1 | Prometheus V: JAX Optimizer v1.2 - Final Validation (Projection) | Prometheus V | 673 | 2.6356279 |\n\nPage 1 of 114 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-114, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n\
